script = ExtResource("1_jurlb")
day_to_send = 2
sender_name = "Arooj"
displayed_time = "7am"
subject = "Residency"
recipient_name = "Sato Wu-Hara"
contents = "[b]SATO WU-HARA:[/b]
Hey Arooj,
How has residency been going? Let me know the next time you're online to play some Pankratia!

[b]AROOJ:[/b]
Hey dude, 
Med school sucks! It feels like the only free time I have, I’m just trying to play video games with Saira (who's now competing in her own tournaments and beating me!) We def gotta play up some games with Dre whenever you guys are free!

[b]SATO WU-HARA:[/b]
Yeah, man. Just think: you’re grinding rn to get that bread- whenever it works out, Insha’Allah. I know it sucks, but keep pushing because soon you’ll be making bank and you’ll be helping people out. That's more than I can say for me rn... I’m just serving drinks still. Hopefully the comic works out, but my style is, well, my style.

[b]AROOJ:[/b]
Bro, what you do matters too. Ya don’t think people come to the cafe for the AI BS, they come for the fact they have a history with what your parents built (and they like seeing what you’re up to). Plus, your drawings are dope, dude. They’re [i]you[/i], which is the important part. Keep at the reps and eventually you’ll pace out and build something solid. [i]Combo Breaker[/i] will hit with the right audience. Insha’Allah our time will come.

[b]SATO WU-HARA:[/b]
Appreciate it bro, Insha’Allah it’ll be ours."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://djk1v35hn3es4"
